<%- include("header", { title: "Home" }) %>
<h1>NutriCheck</h1>
<p>Compare grocery products by their Nutri-Score (A to E), calories and sugar.</p>
<p>Our dataset has <strong><%= total %></strong> products from <a href="https://world.openfoodfacts.org" target="_blank">Open Food Facts</a>, cleaned into a local JSON file.</p>
<h2>Pages</h2>
<ul>
    <li><a href="/products">/products</a> – all products as cards, with food group and Nutri-Score filters</li>
    <li><a href="/search">/search</a> – search form</li>
</ul>
<h2>JSON routes</h2>
<ul>
    <li><a href="/api/products">/api/products</a> – all products</li>
    <li><a href="/api/products/nc-001">/api/products/nc-001</a> – one product by id</li>
    <li><a href="/api/search?keyword=quaker">/api/search?keyword=quaker</a> – search by keyword</li>
    <li><a href="/api/products?grade=a">/api/products?grade=a</a> – filter by Nutri-Score (also &amp;group=)</li>
</ul>
